# ABOUTME: JVM flags for learner programs in the temporal-java sandbox, passed to java as an @argfile.
# Serial GC and C1-only JIT trade peak throughput for faster startup; the rest route HTTP and silence warnings.
-XX:+UseSerialGC
-XX:TieredStopAtLevel=1
--sun-misc-unsafe-memory-access=allow
--enable-native-access=ALL-UNNAMED
-XX:+EnableDynamicAgentLoading
-Dorg.slf4j.simpleLogger.defaultLogLevel=warn
-Dio.grpc.netty.shaded.io.netty.machineId=00:00:00:00:00:00:00:01
# The only route out is the gateway's allowlisting proxy; the dev server stays on loopback.
-Dhttp.proxyHost=gateway
-Dhttp.proxyPort=3128
-Dhttps.proxyHost=gateway
-Dhttps.proxyPort=3128
-Dhttp.nonProxyHosts=localhost|127.0.0.1
